        "original_id": "1cfdc51d-53ff-53ee-b47e-d891f0cc67f6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Feckenham\n- Organizations: Westminster Abbey\n- Places: City of Westminster, London\n- Roles: English churchman, abbot\n\nFacts:\n- John Feckenham, also known as John Howman of Feckingham, John de Feckenham, and John Fecknam, was born around 1515 and died in October 1584.\n- John Feckenham was an English churchman and the last abbot of Westminster.\n- Westminster Abbey is formally titled the Collegiate Church of St Peter at Westminster.\n- Westminster Abbey is a large, mainly Gothic abbey church in the City of Westminster, London, just west of the Palace of Westminster.",
